</selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="dd1a-40e1-d593-4263" name="Pakfront" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
  <profiles>
    <profile id="9685-e6e5-9bb6-4af7" name="Pakfront" typeId="5cbd-556d-67b5-1bd9" typeName="Command Card" hidden="false">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Details" typeId="4091-e11a-c858-f46e">Gun teams in this Unit cannot Move, but can rotate to face the target when Shooting, and are Nests.
Each Gun team is a separate Independent Team.
Nest: The Nests are always Concealed and in Bulletproof Cover.
Teams attacking a Nest must re-roll successful Firepower tests to Destroy it.
Nests cannot Charge into Contact.

LFTF: This card can be used with any Gun Unit, including artillery and anti-aircraft guns. Units using this card cannot fire Artillery Bombardments or shoot at Aircraft. Pakfront Nests do not use the Beach Defences rules from the D-Day: American book.

LFTF: This costs +2 points per Gun team, rather than +6 points for the Unit.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="75a6-20ee-1c76-640a">German, Build, Unit (Gun)</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile id="8199-217f-1b66-7f54" name="Forces ID" typeId="86a9-a6ee-b9bd-dafe" typeName="Forces ID" hidden="false">
